{
 "name": "sounds_v1",
 "version": 1,
 "about": "Whistle and click/pop prompts for extractor/guided_session.py (blocks 'whistles' and 'clicks'). Not personal: prompts only. expect_now = the app's default bindings today (Vocab.DEFAULT_BINDINGS, Sequencer); expect_intent = what the user means (a click run should do nothing: the proposed click train guard). fake = synth.py classes + offsets (s) for --source fake. Retired prompts (\"retired\") are no longer asked; their recorded takes keep the labels they were recorded with, and --score judges every take by today's bindings (expected_now).",
 "whistle_video_note": "the 'video' takes are whistled with a video playing on the COMPUTER speakers (not the phone), normal volume, about 1 m from the mic",
